# The container builds read only these paths. Everything else, including
# .git, docs, and local Terraform state, stays out of the build context, so
# commits and unrelated edits never reach the builder or bust the layer cache.
# Corporate CA certificates and a staged local shell-config live under .local/.
*
!.python-version
!containers/
!ft/
!.local/

# Docs, generated, and test-only paths under the allowed directories.
**/*.md
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv*/
ft/tests/
